# Coordinates for the full marked homology-kernel stabilizer

The adapted basis has columns [E | H | L], of sizes 50, 12 and 50, using the
existing displacement embedding, mixed embedding and displacement lifts.
The inverse and the thirteen proposed radical-K upper blocks are witnesses
read from the published matrices. These definitions assert no finite rank,
completeness, or group-stabilizer claim. Coordinates.lean certifies the basis;
the remaining finite certificates have separate owners.

Source: the unchanged ATLAS matrices in Model.Data, GLS3 Table 5.3i (p.270),
and the reproducible finite calculation documented in source/README.md.
-/

